                "text": "Taiwan was again unjustly blocked from this year\u2019s World Health Assembly due to CCP influence of the @WHO. I am disappointed in these officials again caving to the CCP. #TaiwanCanHelp\n\nCongress is acting to address CCP influence in international organizations. Last Wednesday, the House Foreign Affairs Committee passed my bill, the Taiwan International Solidarity Act, unanimously. It combats China\u2019s attempts to claim sovereignty over Taiwan in international organizations.\nhttps://t.co/s12zUYuo1t",
