                "text": "Thank you @RepBurgessOwens: From water districts to Washington, DC, we need every tool in the toolbox to protect the long-term health of the Great Salt Lake for generations to come. The Great Salt Lake Stewardship Act allocates financial resources for drought mitigation, employs innovative approaches to water conservation, and helps replenish the lake's water levels. I am proud to join the Utah delegation in continuing to bolster local efforts to preserve and maintain our state's precious water resources.",
